    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'll check my tools. i've already honed my chisels to a mirror finish though. could it be something with the way i'm approaching the grain? like, is there a specific way i should be orienting the pins to avoid the splintering?",
      "source": "evaluator"
